SUMMARY:Focker In-Law
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Times: 11:10am\, 1:35pm\, 3:55pm\, 6:20pm\, 7:50pm\, 8:45pm\, 1
 0:10pm\, 11pm\nThis Thanksgiving\, the Circle of Trust expands as Ben Stil
 ler\, Robert De Niro and Ariana Grande star in a hilarious new chapter in 
 the blockbuster Meet the Parents franchise. Still operating as a helicopte
 r parent to his adult kids\, Greg Focker’s anxieties spiral out of contr
 ol when his son brings home a formidable new girlfriend and reveals that h
 e plans to propose.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/focker-in-law/HO
 00001814\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/focker-in-law/HO00001814
END:VEVENT
