 \, 11:10pm\nThe Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping will revisit the worl
 d of Panem twenty-four years before the events of The Hunger Games\, start
 ing on the morning of the reaping of the Fiftieth Hunger Games\, also know
 n as the Second Quarter Quell.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/the-h
 unger-games:-sunrise-on-the-reaping/HO00001788\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass:
  https://pushpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/the-hunger-games:-sunrise-on-the-r
 eaping/HO00001788
