DTSTART:20261128T212000Z
DTEND:20261128T232000Z
SUMMARY:Wild Horse Nine
LOCATION:Beacon Cinema\, 57 North St\, Pittsfield\, MA 01201
DESCRIPTION:Shortly before the 1973 Chilean coup\, CIA agents Chris (John M
 alkovich) and Lee (Sam Rockwell) are dispatched from Santiago to Easter is
 land by their bureau chief\, MJ (Steve Buscemi). Amongst the Island's icon
 ic statues\, and as the longtime partners wrestle with their dark pasts an
 d present conspiracies\, Chris's newfound bond with a pair of rebellious s
 tudents (Mariana di Girolamo and Ailín Salas) threatens to send everyone
 ’s trip to this remote paradise sideways.\nhttps://www.phoenixmovies.net
 /movies/wild-horse-nine/HO00001795\nFrom Pushpin Western Mass: https://pus
 hpin.city/westernma/
URL:https://www.phoenixmovies.net/movies/wild-horse-nine/HO00001795
END:VEVENT
